# Generic host backup set (owner standard: encrypted restic -> B2, 30 days). A machine layer adds its own entries with /etc/ctg-backup/paths.d/*
# (see ctg-restic) and its own `required` list; nothing here names a person or an application.
/home
/etc
/root
/usr/local
/var/spool/cron
/var/lib/portage/world
/var/lib/portage/world_sets
/var/lib/iwd
/var/lib/horcrux
